OL,3,GNEWSALandlord who helped after fatal
OL,4,Acrash given honour
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pub landlord hailed as a "community
OL,7,Fhero" after helping pupils involved in
OL,8,Fa coach crash has been presented with a
OL,9,FBritish Empire Medal (BEM).
OL,11,FEric Norman, 74, landlord of the Rest
OL,12,Fand Be Thankful pub in Wheddon Cross,
OL,13,FMinehead, was given the award for his
OL,14,Factions following the incident at
OL,15,FCutcombe Hill in July 2025.
OL,17,FThe coach had been carrying about 70
OL,18,Fpeople, many of them pupils from
OL,19,FMinehead Middle School. One child died
OL,20,Fand two were seriously injured.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
