OL,3,GNEWSALandlord who helped after fatal
OL,4,Acrash given honour
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorman opened his pub as a rest centre
OL,7,Fand refuge for children, school staff,
OL,8,Fparents and the emergency services
OL,9,Ffollowing the crash. He said he felt
OL,10,F"honoured and humbled" to receive the
OL,11,Faward.
